# Vercel's local link state and the OIDC token it writes next to it.
.vercel

# Every env file, however it's suffixed — added by `vercel link`, and worth
# keeping broad. The example is the one exception: it holds no real values and
# is the documentation of record for which variables exist.
.env*
!.env.example
!apps/api/.env.example
